      "writtenOn": "2025-12-15T14:39:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Loko\u0027s work stream tries to make event triggered on their own without necessarily waiting on Tick/WaitAny/ProcessEvents. Won\u0027t this break down in this case? What\u0027s the advantage compared to a an EnqueueGL here?",
      "revId": "4fcf2c04b5dd317696054a8c5a7ce99522e5fa1b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
